{"id":"6a8759de7e97da40","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-value-of-name.md","title":"ZFC Forcing10 Boolean Value Of Name","display":"df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-value-of-name — ZFC Forcing10 Boolean Value Of Name","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-value-of-name","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-value-of-name"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-value-of-name — ZFC Forcing10 Boolean Value Of Name","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-boolean-value]]","[[58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra]]","[[58-df-ordered-pair]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-value-of-name"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-value-of-name</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing10-boolean-value-of-name — ZFC Forcing10 Boolean Value Of Name"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"62bd0ea842ce3981\" href=\"?note=62bd0ea842ce3981\" title=\"58-df-boolean-value\">58-df-boolean-value</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e2f094f20e94aa6\" href=\"?note=4e2f094f20e94aa6\" title=\"58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra\">58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bea77fab814b3292\" href=\"?note=bea77fab814b3292\" title=\"58-df-ordered-pair\">58-df-ordered-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是固定背景；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,b,\\tau,\\sigma,\\rho,c,D,m,e\\in V\">\\(B,b,\\tau,\\sigma,\\rho,c,D,m,e\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol{\\wedge},\\boldsymbol{\\vee},\\boldsymbol{\\neg},\\boldsymbol0,\\boldsymbol1:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\boldsymbol{\\wedge},\\boldsymbol{\\vee},\\boldsymbol{\\neg},\\boldsymbol0,\\boldsymbol1:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的固定背景类函数；它们是原记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\">\\(\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\)</span> 的指定数据，不在每次布尔值调用时重新选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol\\wedge)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol\\vee)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol\\neg)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol0)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol1)\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol\\wedge)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol\\vee)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol\\neg)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol0)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_B=\\boldsymbol\\wedge(B)\">\\(\\wedge_B=\\boldsymbol\\wedge(B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee_B=\\boldsymbol\\vee(B)\">\\(\\vee_B=\\boldsymbol\\vee(B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_B=\\boldsymbol\\neg(B)\">\\(\\neg_B=\\boldsymbol\\neg(B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_B=\\boldsymbol0(B)\">\\(0_B=\\boldsymbol0(B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_B=\\boldsymbol1(B)\">\\(1_B=\\boldsymbol1(B)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>六参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S\\)</span> 取依赖文件定义；一参数版本仅为上述指定结构的简称，定义见下式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanName}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanNameEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanNameEvaluation}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanNameEquality}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanNameEquality}_S\\)</span> 是下式定义的谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanSup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanSup}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanInf}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanInf}_S\\)</span> 是下式定义的偏类函数，其参数要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq B\">\\(X\\subseteq B\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\tau=\\sigma\\|_B\">\\(\\|\\tau=\\sigma\\|_B\\)</span> 是下式定义的偏值记号；参数要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\)</span> 及两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>-名字。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10BooleanValueOfName}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10BooleanValueOfName}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\leftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal D\\land\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\leftrightarrow\nB\\in\\mathcal D\\land\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\land X\\subseteq B\\ \\to\\\n\\mathrm{BooleanSup}_S(B,X)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup\\{b\\in B:(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\wedge_B(\\langle x,b\\rangle)=x)\\land\n\\forall u\\in B\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;\\wedge_B(\\langle x,u\\rangle)=x)\\to\\wedge_B(\\langle b,u\\rangle)=b)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\land X\\subseteq B\\ \\to\\\n\\mathrm{BooleanSup}_S(B,X)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup\\{b\\in B:(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\wedge_B(\\langle x,b\\rangle)=x)\\land\n\\forall u\\in B\\;((\\forall x\\in X\\;\\wedge_B(\\langle x,u\\rangle)=x)\\to\\wedge_B(\\langle b,u\\rangle)=b)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\land X\\subseteq B\\ \\to\\\n\\mathrm{BooleanInf}_S(B,X)\\coloneqq\\neg_B\\bigl(\\mathrm{BooleanSup}_S(B,\\{\\neg_B(x):x\\in X\\})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\land X\\subseteq B\\ \\to\\\n\\mathrm{BooleanInf}_S(B,X)\\coloneqq\\neg_B\\bigl(\\mathrm{BooleanSup}_S(B,\\{\\neg_B(x):x\\in X\\})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanName}_S(\\tau,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\in V\\;(\\tau\\in D\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in D\\;(\\sigma\\subseteq D\\times B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BooleanName}_S(\\tau,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\in V\\;(\\tau\\in D\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in D\\;(\\sigma\\subseteq D\\times B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BooleanNameEvaluation}_S(m,e,D,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in D\\;(\\sigma\\subseteq D\\times B)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(m,D^2,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,D^2,B)\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\tau,\\sigma\\in D\\;\\Bigl[\nm(\\langle\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle)=\\mathrm{BooleanSup}_S\\left(B,\n\\{\\wedge_B(\\langle c,e(\\langle\\tau,\\rho\\rangle)\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,c\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\}\\right)\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land e(\\langle\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle)=\\mathrm{BooleanInf}_S\\left(B,\n\\{\\vee_B(\\langle\\neg_B(c),m(\\langle\\rho,\\sigma\\rangle)\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,c\\rangle\\in\\tau\\}\n\\cup\\{\\vee_B(\\langle\\neg_B(c),m(\\langle\\rho,\\tau\\rangle)\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,c\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\}\\right)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BooleanNameEvaluation}_S(m,e,D,B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in D\\;(\\sigma\\subseteq D\\times B)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(m,D^2,B)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,D^2,B)\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\tau,\\sigma\\in D\\;\\Bigl[\nm(\\langle\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle)=\\mathrm{BooleanSup}_S\\left(B,\n\\{\\wedge_B(\\langle c,e(\\langle\\tau,\\rho\\rangle)\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,c\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\}\\right)\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land e(\\langle\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle)=\\mathrm{BooleanInf}_S\\left(B,\n\\{\\vee_B(\\langle\\neg_B(c),m(\\langle\\rho,\\sigma\\rangle)\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,c\\rangle\\in\\tau\\}\n\\cup\\{\\vee_B(\\langle\\neg_B(c),m(\\langle\\rho,\\tau\\rangle)\\rangle):\\langle\\rho,c\\rangle\\in\\sigma\\}\\right)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanNameEquality}_S(b,B,\\tau,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,m,e\\in V\\;(\\tau,\\sigma\\in D\\land\\mathrm{BooleanNameEvaluation}_S(m,e,D,B)\\land b=e(\\langle\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BooleanNameEquality}_S(b,B,\\tau,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,m,e\\in V\\;(\\tau,\\sigma\\in D\\land\\mathrm{BooleanNameEvaluation}_S(m,e,D,B)\\land b=e(\\langle\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanName}_S(\\tau,B)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanName}_S(\\sigma,B)\\ \\to\\\n\\|\\tau=\\sigma\\|_B\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{b\\in B:\\mathrm{BooleanNameEquality}_S(b,B,\\tau,\\sigma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CompleteBooleanAlgebra}_S(B)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanName}_S(\\tau,B)\\land\\mathrm{BooleanName}_S(\\sigma,B)\\ \\to\\\n\\|\\tau=\\sigma\\|_B\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{b\\in B:\\mathrm{BooleanNameEquality}_S(b,B,\\tau,\\sigma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10BooleanValueOfName}_S(b,B,\\tau,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,m,e\\in V\\;(\\tau,\\sigma\\in D\\land\\mathrm{BooleanNameEvaluation}_S(m,e,D,B)\\land b=m(\\langle\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10BooleanValueOfName}_S(b,B,\\tau,\\sigma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,m,e\\in V\\;(\\tau,\\sigma\\in D\\land\\mathrm{BooleanNameEvaluation}_S(m,e,D,B)\\land b=m(\\langle\\tau,\\sigma\\rangle)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原四参数谓词仍给出名字成员关系的布尔值。相等值与成员值的递归方程现在同时列出；在名字的秩上递归保证其值不依赖包含这些名字的辅助闭包集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>上下确界取值集合为单点集，故使用该单点集的并提取唯一值；不把布尔载体元素误当作序数上下确界。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-boolean-value","status":"resolved","id":"62bd0ea842ce3981","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-boolean-value]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"4e2f094f20e94aa6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-complete-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordered-pair","status":"resolved","id":"bea77fab814b3292","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordered-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"B,b,\\tau,\\sigma,\\rho,c,D,m,e\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol{\\wedge},\\boldsymbol{\\vee},\\boldsymbol{\\neg},\\boldsymbol0,\\boldsymbol1:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol\\wedge)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol\\vee)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol\\neg)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\boldsymbol0)\\cap\\operatorname{